  <!-- EN: <li>questDescription->[discoveryMethod] the location of an abandoned orbital platform. You don't detect any signs of life.\n\nYou can break in to obtain the loot inside, but the platform probably has defense systems.\n\nYou can travel to orbital locations using gravships, shuttles, or transport pods.</li> -->
