  <OpportunitySite_Asteroid.root.nodes.IsSet.elseNode.nodes.Set.value.slateRef>Keşfettin</OpportunitySite_Asteroid.root.nodes.IsSet.elseNode.nodes.Set.value.slateRef>
  
  <!-- EN: <li>questDescription->[discoveryMethod] the location of an orbital platform. You detect high levels of mechanoid activity.\n\nYou can scavenge valuables from the platform.\n\nYou can travel to orbital locations using gravships, shuttles, or transport pods.</li> -->
